<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>A state that appears because of something the reader did (filtering to nothing) is a polite <code>role="status"</code>. A state that is simply true when the page loads is plain text: announcing it would repeat it.</p></div>

